7/blue-owl-capital-obdc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OBDC 2025 Q2","e":"obdc","d":"2025-08-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Craig Packer","x":"In fact, given the uncertainty around tariffs, we're quite pleased with how our portfolio is performing, which is in line with our expectations given our business mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/blue-owl-capital-obdc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OBDC 2025 Q3","e":"obdc","d":"2025-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Logan Nicholson","x":"It also has tariff-related weakness and tariff-related issues affecting the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/10/blue-owl-capital-obdc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OBDC 2025 Q3","e":"obdc","d":"2025-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Logan Nicholson","x":"And so there's no imminent event or imminent catalyst that we can see, the company is on solid footing and should have a long period of time to try to work through the tariff-related issues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/10/blue-owl-capital-obdc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OBDC 2025 Q3","e":"obdc","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Craig Packer","x":"This merger marks an important step in streamlining our BDC platform while enhancing long-term value for shareholders.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/10/blue-owl-capital-obdc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OBDC 2025 Q3","e":"obdc","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Logan Nicholson","x":"We anticipate approximately $5 million of cost savings in the first year, largely from eliminating duplicative expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/10/blue-owl-capital-obdc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"OBDC 2025 Q4","e":"obdc","d":"2026-02-19","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Craig William Packer","x":"Our 40-person technology investment team re